OL,5,G2330 Dave Allen at Peace
OL,6,     FAidan Gillen stars as the
OL,7,     Flegendary comedian in this
OL,8,     Fbiographical drama, telling the
OL,9,     Fstory from his schoolboy days in
OL,10,     FDublin to becoming one of
OL,11,     Ftelevision's most daring
OL,12,     Fperformers.
